          "excerpt": "MCC is considering establishing a single-award Blanket Purchase Agreement (BPA), with individual orders issued by service area. Please provide feedback on this contemplated structure, including any advantages, disadvantages, pricing considerations, performance risks, or alternative approaches that MCC should consider."
        },
        {
