          "locator": "word/document.xml B309; PWS 4.3.2",
          "excerpt": "Each surge task shall be requested to the Contractor in writing by MCC, with specific requirements. The Contractor shall be required to, within fourteen (14) calendar days, propose corresponding schedules, deliverables, labor requirements, ODC requirements, and budgets. MCC shall formally approve the Contractor’s plans for tasking and schedule before surge resources begin work."
